review:
I'm not a great fan of the Soulslike genre but this game (to me) is different. I don't really know why after doing same things basically - mostly fighting and exploring - I don't feel bored after 90+ hours. So in summary - 
Good:
* gameplay and fighting mechanisms;
* one of a kind world to explore;
* art direction! - full of beautiful vistas and strange enemies;
* dark and moody atmosphere;
* bosses!
* secrets to find;
* huge areas to explore;
* lowered difficulty (in comparison to other Soulslike) but still a challenge;
* unusual plot full of symbolism;
Bad:
* in the beggining can feel overwhelming;
Overall: 9.5 / 10
